# Personal Development Knowledge Base Schema

## Boundaries

- The repository is one Obsidian Vault.
- Each top-level workspace folder is one isolated development iteration.
- Semantic Wiki links may point only inside the current workspace.
- raw Markdown is free-form input and is never overwritten by compile.
- overview.md and index.md are generated pages.
- log.md is append-only.

## Node types

- project
- system
- capability
- gap
- integration
- task
- decision

## Task statuses

- 待开始
- 进行中
- 已阻塞
- 已完成
- 已取消

## Relation syntax

Use a relation label followed by a Wiki link in the node body:

~~~md
- 解决：[[gap-example]]
- 依赖：[[task-example]]
- 关联项目：[[project-example]]
~~~

YAML stores identity, type, status, timestamps and source references; it does not duplicate graph relations.

## Candidate policy

Candidates are suggestions, not formal nodes. User confirmation creates a new formal node and preserves the candidate page as history.
